@startuml SEQ_05_GANTI_PASSWORD
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title SEQ-05 · Ganti Password\nAktor: Admin / Asisten / Kadep / Praktikan

actor       "Pengguna"          as Pengguna
boundary    "Browser"           as Browser
control     "PasswordController" as Controller
entity      "User Model"        as Model
database    "users"             as DB

note over Controller
  Middleware: auth
  Route: PUT /password  (name: password.update)
  Biasanya diakses dari halaman Profile / Settings
end note

== Ganti Password ==

Pengguna -> Browser    : Buka halaman Profile → isi form ganti password
Browser -> Controller  : PUT /password [middleware: auth]\n{current_password, password, password_confirmation}
Controller -> Controller : validate()\ncurrent_password: required|current_password\npassword: required|confirmed|Password::defaults()
alt Validasi Gagal
  Controller --> Browser : 422 + errors
  Browser --> Pengguna   : Sorot field yang tidak valid\n(misal: password lama salah)
else Validasi Lolos
  Controller -> Model    : $request->user()->update({\npassword: Hash::make(password)\n})
  Model -> DB            : UPDATE users SET password = ?\nWHERE id = auth()->id()
  DB --> Model           : affected rows
  Model --> Controller   : success
  Controller --> Browser : back() (redirect kembali ke halaman sebelumnya)
  Browser --> Pengguna   : Tampil notifikasi "Password berhasil diperbarui"
end

@enduml
